<title>GERMANY: MG 4-mo 96/97 pre-tax profit up 15 pct.</title>
<headline>MG 4-mo 96/97 pre-tax profit up 15 pct.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Four months to Jan 31</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit		     38	vs 33</p>
<p>    Group sales				  5,900   vs 4,500</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German diversified metals and trading group is Metallgesellschaft AG.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
